{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**<strong>* Read before purchase\u00a0***</strong><br><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still a <strong>very</strong> early access game, so consider your purchase carefully.\u00a0\u00a0The game currently has about <strong>20%</strong> of the planned content. There are some big empty islands, vehicles, fish to rescue and hats to collect. However save files are not currently available.<br><br>I recommend waiting for the <strong>Spring Sale</strong> or later to purchase. Save files will be ready by then, along with additional content. If you'd prefer to binge the game, I recommend waiting until the end of the year.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>About:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Whelm is about a young penguin, washed up on a mysterious island. Once a thriving sanctuary, it has fallen into disrepair. Rescue animals, tidy up the island and repair machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No missions or levelling up. This is a game about <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>experimentation</strong>. Go at your own pace. Use the monocular to scan the terrain or just pick a direction and go. Getting there is half the fun. <strong>Swim, run, slide, glide or even launch yourself from a cannon.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Current Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see a fish on land, get the poor thing back to the ocean. Some methods are more efficient, but not so... gentle. It's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Beaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Junk can be found scattered around the island. Gather up any garbage you see and carry it to a recycling machine. If you get sick of carrying them one by one there <i>are</i> other ways, but you'll have to figure that out for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find useful machines around the island, but they may be broken or out of power. Batteries can be found or bought from vending machines. If a device still doesn't work, try shouting at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906320?t=1772214158","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/f103cb7f9021366238dfeccc69f28f775f16ff1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772214158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/d4fe0d05230f3731d451117472290d978eab145c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772214158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/d4fe0d05230f3731d451117472290d978eab145c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772214158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4096190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**<strong>* Read before purchase\u00a0***</strong><br><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still a <strong>very</strong> early access game, so consider your purchase carefully.\u00a0\u00a0The game currently has about <strong>20%</strong> of the planned content. There are some big empty islands, vehicles, fish to rescue and hats to collect. However save files are not currently available.<br><br>I recommend waiting for the <strong>Spring Sale</strong> or later to purchase. Save files will be ready by then, along with additional content. If you'd prefer to binge the game, I recommend waiting until the end of the year.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>